# Firmware binaries and flash dumps. A 16 MB read_flash backup holds Wi-Fi and
# API keys; never commit one. Keep backups on a Maciej-only path (see T-027
# checklist). firmware-backups/ is a local name for the same defence.
*.bin
*.elf
*flash*.bin
firmware-backups/
